<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="53a08856"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="e366a750">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirm the understanding about the solution mainly around scope, constraints, requirements, drivers, context and
        current environment.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify and gather the right set of stakeholders to involve in the creation of the concept.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Optionally, prepare and conduct a brainstorming session or a workshop to discuss and draft the concept diagram.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Sketch a diagram that conceptually explains the solution and at a high level shows how the major components or
        parts of the solution interact and come together to address the requirements.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Verify that the concept covers the business, functional and technical perspectives and abstracts the design and
        implementation details of the solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review the diagram with the relevant stakeholders and get them onboard with the proposed solution.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
